OL,3,A'He will never walk free': Indian
OL,4,Ajudge's letter promises child sex abuse
OL,5,Asurvivor
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Indian judge's moving letter
OL,8,Fpraising a child rape survivor for her
OL,9,F"courage" and assuring her that her
OL,10,Fabuser "will live in a cage for the
OL,11,Frest of his life" is winning hearts in
OL,12,FIndia.
OL,14,FTrial court Judge Rajani Ranga's letter
OL,15,Faddresses the 10-year-old, who was
OL,16,Fsexually abused on 23rd July 2023 when
OL,17,Fshe was seven, as "Dear child" and
OL,18,Fdescribes her as "the bravest little
OL,19,Fgirl this court has ever seen".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
