OL,3,A'He will never walk free': Indian
OL,4,Ajudge's letter promises child sex abuse
OL,5,Asurvivor
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe trial court gave the convict a life
OL,8,Fsentence, emphasising that he would
OL,9,Fremain in prison for "the remainder of
OL,10,Fhis natural life" and also awarded the
OL,11,Fsurvivor a compensation of 1.05m rupees
OL,12,F($10,941; #8,274).
OL,14,FAt the end of her order, Judge Ranga
OL,15,Fsaid she "must address the child victim
OL,16,F- not in the formal language of a
OL,17,Fjudgment but as a judge who has heard
OL,18,Fher voice, who has read her words, and
OL,19,Fwho has been moved by her courage".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
